    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What stays unchanged",
      "items": [
        "AddServiceBus still provisions the emulator container, its SQL Server dependency, bind mount and WaitFor regardless of a redirect.",
        "PrimaryEndpoint always points at the emulator; the redirect only changes ConnectionStringExpression and GetConnectionStringAsync.",
        "The annotation is read fresh on every call, so it can be applied or changed at any point before the value is resolved."
      ]
    }
